WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:127826

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.102
Great work completing this course.

2
00:00:02.202 --> 00:00:04.270
You've seen how to go from vibe coding

3
00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:08.375
where you hope the agent does what you want, to Spec-Driven Development

4
00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:11.478
where you get closer to what you actually need.

5
00:00:11.978 --> 00:00:16.082
You've written constitutions, planned features through conversation,

6
00:00:16.483 --> 00:00:18.785
validated as the human in the loop,

7
00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:22.389
and automated your workflow with skills and standards.

8
00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:26.893
The specs you write today become the memory of your projects tomorrow.

9
00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:29.696
Keep them sharp, keep improving your process,

10
00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:34.200
and remember, the best code starts with a great spec.

11
00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:36.369
You and many of the engineers

12
00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:38.438
I know may have seen the consequences

13
00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:40.173
of moving too fast.

14
00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:42.542
Let's bring back some engineering.

15
00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:45.345
Let's keep you as the driver of your software.

16
00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:49.749
I really care about finding the joy and purpose in all things.

17
00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:52.152
And I'm excited to see what you do with this.

18
00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:56.489
Take it easy. Go, do some cool stuff.
